+  *                                                 memory for the output
+  *                                                 payload. This may be
+  *                                                 used to impose an upper limit on
+  *                                                 the instant bitrate, but should
+  *                                                 not be used as the only bitrate
+  *                                                 control. Use #OPUS_SET_BITRATE to
+  *                                                 control the bitrate.
