+  *                                                loss.
+  * @param len <tt>opus_int32</tt>: Number of bytes in payload.
+  * @param[out] pcm <tt>opus_int16*</tt>: Output signal, with interleaved
+  *                                       samples.
+  *                                       This must contain room for
+  *                                       <code>frame_size*channels</code>
+  *                                       samples.
